o! Your art style is really soft and cute! I would love for you to draw my OC. Her name is Heda. She is confident and sassy.\n\nHere is what she looks like and what I'd like her outfit to be:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/14wej2r8Z09mtq8DGysJ0wyt_I1NDqwxg\nThe other photo is references for the earring, which is not necessary.\n\nI will leave the composition, pose, expressions, and background up to you.\nMay I please just ask for no \"nyan\" cat pose and no tongue sticking out expression.\n\nNotes:\n- Her facial markings\n- Her feathers on the sides of her head\n- Her breasts size is B cup\n\nHere is a folder that shows her personality, maybe that might help:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ez1xyMmhjaEOI5OPDjG0XAaCvsNsEXIK\n\nThank you for considering!", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@nanamidanamida/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2438147, "client_id": 2168110, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/28af90c7/uploads/origins/02362333-04d5-4459-9908-ff04eb5403b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5edf3729744f5913457c4fe7e2b45cb6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/28af90c7/uploads/origins/02362333-04d5-4459-9908-ff04eb5403b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5edf3729744f5913457c4fe7e2b45cb6, https://si.imgix.net/28af90c7/uploads/origins/02362333-04d5-4459-9908-ff04eb5403b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db57b87bac7a3139ee5a26c983dcd871 2x, https://si.imgix.net/28af90c7/uploads/origins/02362333-04d5-4459-9908-ff04eb5403b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8588ee699533d79ddcb3d0788fb4c85a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.ne