s messenger, a pack of golden spiders (Hyakumei-Sente-no-Oh).\nEncouraged by Hina Asahina, he overcame his trauma and defeated an army of enemy large demons single-handedly, but was shot from behind by her, wounding him to death.\nWith Kirigane Akane dying, the Golden Spider Swarm broke free from her control, preying on Kirigane Akane, taking her power and running amok.\n\"\"\"\".\nI am considering using it for personal activities in general (illustrations for novels, etc., introduction of characters on SNS, personal websites, etc., announcements of personal activities, etc.).\nIf it is convenient for you, I would appreciate it.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CO9bBqUZLNsQSVsLOQqJPRYWcbfJcQYo", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": []}, "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 2000, "recorded_at": 1774042075.052719}]}, "custom": {}}